    <body>
        <segment id="1" parent="13" relname="span">check it out: lefty keyboard (and wireless)</segment>
        <segment id="2" parent="1" relname="enablement">http:// shop. store. yahoo. com/ directron/ lefthanded.html</segment>
        <segment id="3" parent="4" relname="concession">I'm also left-handed,</segment>
        <segment id="4" parent="14" relname="span">but at this stage in my life I don't know if I'dlike a lefty keyboard!</segment>
        <segment id="5" parent="16" relname="background">That sword- fighting story is new to me.</segment>
        <segment id="6" parent="18" relname="circumstance">I've had SO many people tell methat a bunch of years ago,</segment>
        <segment id="7" parent="18" relname="span">lefties were not admired</segment>
        <segment id="8" parent="19" relname="span">so they were forcedto use their right hands,</segment>
        <segment id="9" parent="8" relname="concession">although several have told me of an initiallefty preference.</segment>
        <segment id="10" parent="16" relname="contrast">Frankly, I'm trying to steer my 1-year-old into beinga lefty ;)</segment>
        <group id="11" type="multinuc"/>
